    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38375" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαύλ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		 sq. <i><span class="en">
			2
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			344.98
		</span></i> (Teos, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
			<u>OGI</u>
			765.13
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Priene</span>), <i><span class="en">
			Call.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			131.4
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Plb.
			4.4.1
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			2.508d
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Alciphr.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			6.4
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐπαύλια</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐπαυλία</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρα</span>) <i>the day after the wedding,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; also, <i>presents given to the bride,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
			</span></i> l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαύλιος: ἡ τῆς αὐλῆς ὁδός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zonar.
			</span></i></div>
